<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Commercial H1 net up 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Commercial H1 net up 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,737.51    vs	1,451.32</p>
<p>    Net profit	     202.79    vs	  188.31</p>
<p>    Tax provision	   75.50    vs	   77.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Commercial Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed on the Colombo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
